  (text "OPENTHERM MASTER ADAPTER (Ihor Melnyk topology). Bus is boiler-powered SELV, polarity independent. OT_OUT high -> U201 on -> extra bus current (TX). Boiler voltage high -> D206 conducts -> Q201 on -> U202 on -> OT_IN high (RX). D208 TVS is DNP."
    (at 20 30 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "5e89731f-7dcb-4458-b004-f5de5dbc498c")
  )
